      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\text{由}\\chi^2 \\text{分布的定义有}\\quad&amp;Z_1=(\\frac{X_1}{4})^2+(\\frac{X_2}{4})+\\cdots+(\\frac{X_9}{4})^2\\sim \\chi^2(9)\\,,\\\\&amp;Z_2=(\\frac{Y_1}{3})^2+(\\frac{Y_2}{3})+\\cdots+(\\frac{Y_{16}}{3})^2\\sim \\chi^2(16)\\,,\\\\ \\text{由}F \\text{分布的定义得出}\\quad&amp;\\frac{Z_1/9}{Z_2/16}\\sim F(9,16)\\,,\\\\ \\text{即}\\quad&amp;\\frac{X_1^2+X_2^2+\\cdots+X_9^2}{Y_1^2+Y_2^2+\\cdots+Y_{16}^2}\\sim F(9,16)\\,.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}\\text{由}\\chi^2 \\text{分布的定义有}\\quad&amp;Z_1=(\\frac{X_1}{4})^2+(\\frac{X_2}{4})+\\cdots+(\\frac{X_9}{4})^2\\sim \\chi^2(9)\\,,\\\\&amp;Z_2=(\\frac{Y_1}{3})^2+(\\frac{Y_2}{3})+\\cdots+(\\frac{Y_{16}}{3})^2\\sim \\chi^2(16)\\,,\\\\ \\text{由}F \\text{分布的定义得出}\\quad&amp;\\frac{Z_1/9}{Z_2/16}\\sim F(9,16)\\,,\\\\ \\text{即}\\quad&amp;\\frac{X_1^2+X_2^2+\\cdots+X_9^2}{Y_1^2+Y_2^2+\\cdots+Y_{16}^2}\\sim F(9,16)\\,.\\end{aligned}</div>"
