          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\text{设} \\, X_{1}, X_{2}, \\cdots , X_{n} \\text{是来自于总体} X \\sim N(\\mu , \\sigma^{2}) \\text{样本，} \\, \\overline{X} \\text{是样本均值，则} \\, \\sum_{i = 1}^{n} \\frac{(X_{i} - \\overline{X})^{2}}{\\sigma^{2}} \\sim \\chi^{2}(n)\">\\text{设} \\, X_{1}, X_{2}, \\cdots , X_{n} \\text{是来自于总体} X \\sim N(\\mu , \\sigma^{2}) \\text{样本，} \\, \\overline{X} \\text{是样本均值，则} \\, \\sum_{i = 1}^{n} \\frac{(X_{i} - \\overline{X})^{2}}{\\sigma^{2}} \\sim \\chi^{2}(n)</span>"
