      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{因}X_{i}\\sim N(0,0.3^{2})\\text{，故} &amp; &amp; \\frac{X_{i}}{0.3}\\sim N(0,1)\\,,\\ i=1,2,\\cdots,10\\,,\\\\ &amp; &amp; &amp; \\chi^{2}=\\sum_{i=1}^{10}(\\frac{X_{i}}{0.3})^{2}=\\sum_{i=1}^{10}\\frac{X_{i}^{2}}{0.3^{2}}\\sim\\chi^{2}(10)\\,,\\\\ &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ &amp; \\text{从而} &amp; &amp; P\\{\\sum_{i=1}^{10}X_{i}^{2}&gt;1.44\\}=P\\{\\sum_{i=1}^{10}\\frac{X_{i}^{2}}{0.3^{2}}&gt;16\\}=P\\{\\chi^{2}&gt;16\\}=0.1\\,.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{因}X_{i}\\sim N(0,0.3^{2})\\text{，故} &amp; &amp; \\frac{X_{i}}{0.3}\\sim N(0,1)\\,,\\ i=1,2,\\cdots,10\\,,\\\\ &amp; &amp; &amp; \\chi^{2}=\\sum_{i=1}^{10}(\\frac{X_{i}}{0.3})^{2}=\\sum_{i=1}^{10}\\frac{X_{i}^{2}}{0.3^{2}}\\sim\\chi^{2}(10)\\,,\\\\ &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ &amp; \\text{从而} &amp; &amp; P\\{\\sum_{i=1}^{10}X_{i}^{2}&gt;1.44\\}=P\\{\\sum_{i=1}^{10}\\frac{X_{i}^{2}}{0.3^{2}}&gt;16\\}=P\\{\\chi^{2}&gt;16\\}=0.1\\,.\\end{aligned}</div>"
